{"4020370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Boxcutter", "steam_appid": 4020370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You’re Benjamin</strong>, a desperate lowlife with debts you can’t escape. Armed with your <strong>fists</strong>, <strong>trash talk</strong>, and a <strong>boxcutter</strong>, you fight to survive in the crooked city of <strong>Copenhagen</strong> that couldn’t care less if you make it out...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/44262337c4ed66c50b7c10bce2f932eb.poster.avif?t=1784484622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/44262337c4ed66c50b7c10bce2f932eb.webm?t=1784484622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break</strong> into cars, <strong>rip</strong> out stereos and <strong>pocket</strong> what's yours. <strong>Rob</strong> the store, <strong>snatch</strong> bottles off the street and <strong>take</strong> every scrap you can find. Theft isn’t optional, it’s survival...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/adbb878a045ce31478312b4789c6eda2.poster.avif?t=1784484622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/adbb878a045ce31478312b4789c6eda2.webm?t=1784484622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade your loot for dirty cash</strong>, the only currency that keeps you moving forward. Nothing in Copenhagen comes free, and every coin you scrape together pushes you closer to crawling out of debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/12d9b1e2c60436aa44d5d264da44f6c3.poster.avif?t=1784484622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/12d9b1e2c60436aa44d5d264da44f6c3.webm?t=1784484622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your cash on  improving your apartment, fresh clothes, or masks that give you strange buffs and a warped sense of identity. <strong>Comfort doesn’t last, but it might keep you alive.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/226a41f5aa02d04800247b7bd9da096c.poster.avif?t=1784484622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/226a41f5aa02d04800247b7bd9da096c.webm?t=1784484622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash-talk strangers, push back against gangs and <strong>let your  boxcutter do the rest</strong>. Violence and fear are your only real languages in these streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/6474b38d11041a02b61286b3a31664f2.poster.avif?t=1784484622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/6474b38d11041a02b61286b3a31664f2.webm?t=1784484622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam a distorted version of <strong>Copenhagen</strong> in the early 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore &amp; Dismemberment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets &amp; Cheat codes</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You’re Benjamin</strong>, a desperate lowlife with debts you can’t escape. Armed with your <strong>fists</strong>, <strong>trash talk</strong>, and a <strong>boxcutter</strong>, you fight to survive in the crooked city of <strong>Copenhagen</strong> that couldn’t care less if you make it out...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/44262337c4ed66c50b7c10bce2f932eb.poster.avif?t=1784484622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/44262337c4ed66c50b7c10bce2f932eb.webm?t=1784484622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break</strong> into cars, <strong>rip</strong> out stereos and <strong>pocket</strong> what's yours. <strong>Rob</strong> the store, <strong>snatch</strong> bottles off the street and <strong>take</strong> every scrap you can find. Theft isn’t optional, it’s survival...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/adbb878a045ce31478312b4789c6eda2.poster.avif?t=1784484622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/adbb878a045ce31478312b4789c6eda2.webm?t=1784484622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade your loot for dirty cash</strong>, the only currency that keeps you moving forward. Nothing in Copenhagen comes free, and every coin you scrape together pushes you closer to crawling out of debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/12d9b1e2c60436aa44d5d264da44f6c3.poster.avif?t=1784484622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/12d9b1e2c60436aa44d5d264da44f6c3.webm?t=1784484622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your cash on  improving your apartment, fresh clothes, or masks that give you strange buffs and a warped sense of identity. <strong>Comfort doesn’t last, but it might keep you alive.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/226a41f5aa02d04800247b7bd9da096c.poster.avif?t=1784484622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/226a41f5aa02d04800247b7bd9da096c.webm?t=1784484622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash-talk strangers, push back against gangs and <strong>let your  boxcutter do the rest</strong>. Violence and fear are your only real languages in these streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/6474b38d11041a02b61286b3a31664f2.poster.avif?t=1784484622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/extras/6474b38d11041a02b61286b3a31664f2.webm?t=1784484622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam a distorted version of <strong>Copenhagen</strong> in the early 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore &amp; Dismemberment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets &amp; Cheat codes</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Beg, borrow, steal, and kill your way out of debt in this open-world crime action-adventure set in the twisted city of Copenhagen at the turn of the 2000s.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/272197e31c6ec16a86dee6c01809329681b7c84a/header.jpg?t=1784484622", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/9391df14a06e293271e90e40353de861e5d053b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784484622", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020370/9391df14a06e293271e90e40353de861e5d053b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784484622", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br